{"speciesId":843,"names":{"fr":"Dunaja","es":"Silicobra","en":"Silicobra","ja":"スナヘビ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il amasse le sable qu’il avale en creusant dans la poche de son cou. Elle peut en contenir jusqu’à huit kilos."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Almacena la arena que ingiere al perforar hoyos en la saca del cuello, cuya capacidad llega a alcanzar incluso los 8 kg."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"As it digs, it swallows sand and stores it in its neck pouch. The pouch can hold more than 17 pounds of sand."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"穴を 掘りながら 食べた 砂を 首の 袋に 溜めている。 ８キロもの 砂が 入るのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"En expulsant du sable par les narines, il aveugle son adversaire et en profite pour se cacher sous terre."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Expulsa arena por los orificios nasales. Una vez que aturde al enemigo, aprovecha la ocasión para ocultarse bajo tierra."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It spews sand from its nostrils. While the enemy is blinded, it burrows into the ground to hide."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"鼻の 穴から 砂を 噴射。 敵の 目を くらました 隙に 地中に 潜って 身を 隠す。"}],"varieties":[{"id":843,"moves":[{"name":"slam","learns":[[20,"level-up",40],[25,"level-up",40]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[20,"level-up",20],[25,"level-up",20]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"dig","learns":[[20,"level-up",30],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",30],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"screech","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"minimize","learns":[[20,"level-up",5],[25,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"glare","learns":[[20,"level-up",25],[25,"level-up",25]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[20,"machin